{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49390","headline":"虞美人 二 · 毛文锡","name":"虞美人 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宝檀金缕鸳鸯枕，绶带盘宫锦。\n夕阳低映小窗明，南园绿树语莺莺，梦难成。\n玉炉香煖频添炷，满地飘轻絮。\n珠帘不卷度沈烟，庭前闲立画秋千，艳阳天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛文锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49390.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49390","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}